# The Shadower's third class node, and the one skill here with two forms. GMS
# calls them Eviscerate Fail and Eviscerate Success, which is the whole
# mechanism: one key, and which form comes out depends on whether an enemy has a
# full wound, not on the player.
#
# Used without one it summons hidden allies: 675+27x% five times across ten
# enemies, on a 14-second cooldown. Used on a full wound, the Shadower appears
# behind that enemy and slashes five times for 825+33x% seven times, with the
# crit rate, Ignore DEF, 1.8 seconds of invulnerability and the longer 20-second
# cooldown GMS states for that case only.
#
# The wound is defined here because GMS attaches it to this skill's passive
# half: Assassinate and Sonic Blow cause it without mentioning it, and neither
# does until this node is bought. Assassinate's finishing blow adds one stack
# and every Sonic Blow attack adds three, so one Sonic Blow fills the wound, as
# do three Assassinates. Only one enemy has it at a time.
#
# Nothing here reads the wound for damage: GMS's tooltip gives no bonus per
# stack, and the wound only unlocks the stronger form.
#
# Dropped: the 650 MP, the link windows after Assassinate and Sonic Blow (there
# is no key to press), and both forms' immunity to attack reflection.
name: "Trickblade"
description:
  "Summon your hidden friends to strike the enemies around you. Against an "
  "enemy wounded deeply enough, move behind it instead and cut it down."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ATTACK
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_SHADOWER_V skill_order: 3 }
v_node: V_NODE_KIND_JOB
max_level: 30
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_DAGGER
base_delay_ms: 480
cooldown_seconds: 14.0
max_enemies: 10
lines: 5
base { skill_pct: 7.02 }
per_level { skill_pct: 0.27 }
buff {
  needs_wound_form: true
  duration_seconds: 1.8
  base { damage_taken_pct: 1.00 }
}
wound {
  duration_seconds: 10.0
  max_stacks: 3
  source { skill_name: "Assassinate" stacks: 1 }
  source { skill_name: "Sonic Blow" stacks: 3 }
  form {
    label: "Trickblade Finish"
    max_enemies: 1
    lines: 7
    casts: 5
    base_delay_ms: 1200
    cooldown_seconds: 20.0
    base {
      skill_pct: 8.58
      crit_rate: 1.00
      ied_pct: 1.00
    }
    per_level { skill_pct: 0.33 }
  }
}
